                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d5a5b3c-e219-3480-8311-3f89f8cda1f0",
                        "entry_id": "5a42f90f-2c45-3ed1-aa69-b57628bc368c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An analgesic or other source of relief from pain"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "01699b03-3956-49b3-98c5-ff9ccf1a241d",
                                "sense_id": "4d5a5b3c-e219-3480-8311-3f89f8cda1f0",
                                "text": "It is now full time to free him from all these necessities, and to apply cordials and lenitives, after those severities which have already had their full course against him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f107dd7-c2ba-4e36-9403-aa62666d875c",
                                "sense_id": "4d5a5b3c-e219-3480-8311-3f89f8cda1f0",
                                "text": "Upon the whole, as the author seems to share all the common miseries of life, he appears to partake likewise of its lenitives and abatements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5495806a-9cdb-4591-ae02-d6571bf6e545",
                                "sense_id": "4d5a5b3c-e219-3480-8311-3f89f8cda1f0",
                                "text": "Their pain soft arts of pharmacy can ease, Thy breast alone no lenitives appease."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dcc91a17-d697-3b0b-8f1a-faede6c520b6",
